# Migration scripts live here.
#
# The first migration is Phase 2 work: it is blocked on the event model
# decision (Architecture Review C3), and writing it against the documented
# Crowd Event shape would guarantee a rewrite.
#
# Generate with:
#   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"
#
# Always read a generated migration before applying it. Autogeneration detects
# most schema changes but not all - notably it will not infer a data migration.
